| TEXAS INSTRUMENTS INCORPORATED
| Standard Linear and Logic Group
| IBIS Model of SN74LVC1G123
| SINGLE RETRIGGERABLE MONOSTABLE MULTIVIBRATOR WITH SCHMITT-TRIGGER
| INPUTS
| This file contains package information for the following:
|  TSSOP 8-pin (DCU) package as [Component] LVC1G123_DCU
|  TSSOP 8-pin (DCT) package as [Component] LVC1G123_DCT
|  DSBGA 8-pin (YEP_YZP) package as [Component] LVC1G123_YEP_YZP
| This device can be powered at the following Vccs:
|  1.8 volt Vcc
|  2.5 volt Vcc
|  3.3 volt Vcc
|  5 volt Vcc
| This file provides unique models under the [Model Selector] for each Vcc.
| For operation at a specific Vcc, select the appropriate model after each
| [Model Selector] keyword.
|##############################################################################
|
[IBIS Ver]      3.2
[Comment char]  |_char
[File Name]     sn74lvc1g123.ibs
[File Rev]      1.1 | x_die
[Date]          February 17, 2004 
[Source]        Data created from TI-SPICE simulations at TI-SLL.
[Notes]         The following is an IBIS list for the LVC1G123.
                Please contact sllibis@ti.com with questions and
                comments concerning SLL IBIS models.
                - FILE REV HISTORY
                - 1.1 Release IBIS file on 04/02/04
                - YEP and YZP packages are package preview only at this date.
                - Power clamp data deleted as there is no power-clamp diode.
                - Due to the fact that the Device is 5.5-V Input tolarent, 
                  the pulldown model has some Non-Monotonic Warnings.
